# Tests for the Form1099_misc module (Alaska PFD)

Run with `clerk test`. Oracle comparison: `make difftest SCOPE=form1099_misc`.

> Using Form1099_misc
> Using Types

```catala
declaration scope MkM:
  input box3 content money
  input box4 content money
  output form content Form1099_misc.Form1099Misc

scope MkM:
  definition form equals
    Form1099_misc.Form1099Misc {
      -- filer: Types.FilerRole.PrimaryFiler
      -- is_alaska_pfd: true
      -- writable_other_income: box3
      -- writable_federal_withholding: box4
    }
```

## PFD of $1,702.00 is $1,702 on Schedule 1 line 8g

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestPfd1702:
  output ok condition
  m scope MkM
  s scope Form1099_misc.Form1099Miscs

scope TestPfd1702:
  definition m.box3 equals $1,702.00
  definition m.box4 equals $0
  definition s.form_1099miscs equals [m.form]
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income = $1,702
  assertion s.has_alaska_pfd_income
  assertion s.has_1099_misc
  assertion s.form_1099_misc_federal_income_tax_withheld = $0
  assertion not s.unsupported
  # known-bad outputs are rejected
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income != $1,701
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income != $0
  rule ok fulfilled
```

## Rounding and withholding

Two dividends of $1,000.40 and $1,000.40 total $2,000.80, rounded once to
$2,001. Box 4 of $10.40 and $10.40 totals $20.80, rounded once to $21, flowing
to Form 1040 line 25b.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestRoundedOnceAndWithholding:
  output ok condition
  m1 scope MkM
  m2 scope MkM
  s scope Form1099_misc.Form1099Miscs

scope TestRoundedOnceAndWithholding:
  definition m1.box3 equals $1,000.40
  definition m1.box4 equals $10.40
  definition m2.box3 equals $1,000.40
  definition m2.box4 equals $10.40
  definition s.form_1099miscs equals [m1.form; m2.form]
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income = $2,001
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income != $2,000
  assertion s.form_1099_misc_federal_income_tax_withheld = $21
  assertion s.form_1099_misc_federal_income_tax_withheld != $20
  rule ok fulfilled

#[test]
declaration scope TestNoForms:
  output ok condition
  s scope Form1099_misc.Form1099Miscs

scope TestNoForms:
  definition s.form_1099miscs equals []
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income = $0
  assertion not s.has_alaska_pfd_income
  assertion not s.has_1099_misc
  rule ok fulfilled
```

## A 1099-MISC that is not a PFD is excluded from line 8g and knocked out

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestNonPfdKnockedOut:
  output ok condition
  s scope Form1099_misc.Form1099Miscs

scope TestNonPfdKnockedOut:
  definition s.form_1099miscs equals
    [ Form1099_misc.Form1099Misc {
        -- filer: Types.FilerRole.PrimaryFiler
        -- is_alaska_pfd: false
        -- writable_other_income: $500
        -- writable_federal_withholding: $0 } ]
  assertion s.alaska_pfd_income = $0
  assertion s.ko_non_pfd_1099_misc
  assertion s.unsupported
  rule ok fulfilled
```
